\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Decision-aware compression vs.\ paired naive truncation (family-cluster bootstrap, 2000 reps). $\tau _{\mathrm  {replay}}=A11-A10$; E1 is the paired difference of replay terms (\textsc  {dslice} minus \textsc  {raw\_matched}); E2 is the \textsc  {dslice} replay term itself. All $p$-values in this table are Holm-adjusted within the primary $m=6$ family. Guardrails are one-sided noninferiority checks: $\Delta $HFR (upper-95 $<+5$pp) is primary, a member of that family; $\Delta \tau _{\mathrm  {trap}}$ (lower-95 $>-5$pp) is secondary, outside the Holm family (``not est.'' = bound crosses the margin). \textsc  {dslice} cards: mean 237.5 tokens.}}{9}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
